in platform before any first shipment to a customer. This rung holds when that, or any other decision against the event of rung 1 as a whole, or a formal abandonment or withdrawal of it as a whole, was made after 2026-07-02 and stands on 2026-12-31, and only when rung 1 does not.\",\n      \"lo\": null,\n      \"hi\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"position\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"Still open\",\n      \"condition\": \"Neither rung 1 nor rung 2 holds on 2026-12-31.\",\n      \"lo\": null,\n      \"hi\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reader_b_decisive_items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i105\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-05\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia's next-gen AI rack system delayed to 2028 on manufacturing snags, SemiAnalysis says\",\n      \"passage\": \"Nvidia's current-generation Rubin systems are in full production and begin shipping this fall to eight cloud partners\",\n      \"meaning\": {\n        \"who\": \"NVIDIA\",\n        \"what\": \"Vera Rubin systems in full production; shipping to eight cloud partners including AWS, Microsoft Azure and Google Cloud\",\n        \"period\": \"this fall (2026)\",\n        \"status\": \"happened (full production); plan (shipping this fall)\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i219\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-06\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia Vera Rubin rack costs $7.8M — memory is why\",\n      \"passage\": \"First shipments are scheduled for the third quarter of 2026, with volume ramping in the fourth.\",\n      \"meaning\": {\n        \"what\": \"Vera Rubin VR200 NVL72 first shipments and volume ramp\",\n        \"period\": \"first shipments Q3 2026; volume ramp Q4 2026\",\n        \"status\": \"plan\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i202\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-06\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia's Kyber rack for Rubin Ultra reportedly delayed to 2028, stopgap solution also axed due to customer pushback — Analyst firm SemiAnalysis says PCB midplane problems led to the delay [Updated]\",\n      \"passage\": \