\"Will China's government or a regulator permit NVIDIA to sell H200 AI chips to Chinese customers by 2027-01-31, as shown by an official Chinese decision or NVIDIA-confirmed H200 shipments or revenue to Chinese customers?\",\n    \"looks_at\": \"A Chinese government/regulator decision allowing H200 sales in China, evidenced by an official Chinese decision or by NVIDIA-confirmed H200 shipments/revenue to Chinese customers.\",\n    \"due_day\": \"2027-01-31\",\n    \"year\": \"2027\",\n    \"kind\": \"theme\"\n  },\n  \"judged_rungs\": [\n    {\n      \"position\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"condition\": \"By 2027-01-31, an official Chinese government or regulator decision permits H200 sales to Chinese customers, or NVIDIA confirms H200 shipments or revenue to Chinese customers.\",\n      \"lo\": null,\n      \"hi\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"position\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"Ruled out\",\n      \"condition\": \"The Chinese government or a Chinese regulator formally denies permission for H200 sales to Chinese customers or formally prohibits those sales. This rung holds when that, or any other decision against the event of rung 1 as a whole, or a formal abandonment or withdrawal of it as a whole, was made after 2026-07-02 and stands on 2027-01-31, and only when rung 1 does not.\",\n      \"lo\": null,\n      \"hi\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"position\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"Still open\",\n      \"condition\": \"Neither rung 1 nor rung 2 holds on 2027-01-31.\",\n      \"lo\": null,\n      \"hi\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reader_b_decisive_items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i270\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-08\",\n      \"title\": \"China to let AI firms buy Nvidia H200s, says report\",\n      \"passage\": \"China plans to allow top artificial intelligence companies to buy a limited amount of H200 chips from Nvidia\",\n      \"meaning\": {\n        \"who\": \"Chinese officials\",\n        \"what\": \"permission for top AI companies (Alibaba, ByteDance, DeepSeek) to buy NVIDIA H200 chips, each on approval stating the number and reason\",\n        \"how_much\": \"a limited amount; total may be fewer than 200,000\",\n        \"condition\": \"approval per request; limited amount\",\n        \"status\": \"rumour\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i304\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-14\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia slashes list of authorized customers in Asia in a bid to reduce AI chip smuggling, report claims — company sent field inspectors, called customers to check if business is genuine after pressure from Washington\",\n      \"passage\": \"Beijing refused to allow Chinese companies to buy these AI processors\",\n      \"meaning\": {\n        \"who\": \"Beijing\",\n        \"what\": \"Chinese companies not allowed to buy NVIDIA H200\",\n        \"status\": \"happened\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i305\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-14\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia slashes list of authorized customers in Asia in a bid to reduce AI chip smuggling, report claims — company sent field inspectors, called customers to check if business is genuine after pressure from Washington\",\n      \"passage\": \"all domestic suppliers are sold out and that they’re even considering less powerful chips\",\n      \"meaning\": {\n        \"who\": \"unnamed Chinese tech executive\",\n        \"what\": \"China's domestic AI-chip suppliers are sold out; buyers are considering less powerful chips\",\n        \"status\": \"claim\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"i309\",\n      \"day\": \"2026-07-14\",\n      \"title\": \"Nvidia slashes list of authorized customers in Asia in a bid to reduce AI chip smuggling, report claims — company sent field inspectors, called customers to check if business is genuine after pressure from Washington\",\n      \"passage\": \"President Donald Trump took a 180-degree turn in December 2025 and finally allowed Nvidia to export its H200 GPUs to select customers in the region\",\n      \